     a deprecation path.
  2. [1mEmit both fields[0m — return [38;5;153muserId[39m and [38;5;153muser_id[39m for a transition window, then drop [38;5;153muserId[39m once consumers migrate.
     Cheapest path to consistency, non-breaking today.
  3. [1mStraight rename[0m — exactly what you asked. One line, breaks the three consumers the moment it deploys.

